    "body": "RazorpayX Payroll needed awareness among HR professionals. They are the right audience, but a finance-heavy product is a tough sell to people who rarely engage with branded content.\n\nA recent launch gave us a way in: an AI feature that lets employees talk directly to their payslips and ask salary questions. HRs showed genuine traction, which made us dig deeper into why."
